# Signature candidates under review: NOT one-hit blocking rules.
# Format: id|state|category|regex|notes
vite-fs-env|REVIEW|secret|/@fs/[^ ?]*\.env(?:\?|$)|Vite probe: verify target parsing and legitimate use
encoded-dotdot-slash|REVIEW|traversal|\.\.%2[fF]|Encoded traversal: context required
ntfs-ads-dotenv|REVIEW|secret|/\.env[^ ?]*::\$DATA|NTFS ADS-looking probe; validate escaping
wp-json-enumeration|REVIEW|wordpress-recon|/(?:blog/|wp/|wordpress/|site/|news/)?wp-json/?(?:$|\?)|Suspicious only as a burst across install prefixes
wordpress-php-enumeration|REVIEW|wordpress-suspicious-php|/wp-(?:sanita|devirot|devirus|devisue|conflg|access)\.php(?:$|\?)|Correlate bursts; not one-hit ban
backup-env-family|REVIEW|env-backup-enumeration|/(?:\.env\.[0-9]+|env\.(?:bak|old|save))(?:$|\?)|Multiple backup probes required
wp-maljum-php|REVIEW|wordpress-suspicious-php|/wp-content/maljum\.php(?:$|\?)|Observed 2026-11-15; unconfirmed webshell
